      "source": "The <a href=\"#setClassFilter(org.springframework.aop.ClassFilter)\"><code>\"classFilter\"</code></a> property can be set to customize\n<a href=\"../ClassFilter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop\"><code>ClassFilter</code></a> behavior. The default is <a href=\"../ClassFilter.html#TRUE\"><code>ClassFilter.TRUE</code></a>.",
